  "content": "<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/vji2jji26v_img1.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>beautiful.ai 之前快300万访问量，这三个月降一半了，只剩150万左右。</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/vji2jji26v_img2.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>注意这个词 Presentations ，老外语境里就是幻灯片、图表等演示文稿。</div>\n<div>我们如果做AI幻灯片，不要只会用 ppt 、 slides 等关键词。</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/vji2jji26v_img3.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/vji2jji26v_img4.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/vji2jji26v_img5.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>wordcounter.net 流量好坚挺，有搜索引擎源源不断补充新流量，自己也能留住老用户。</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/vji2jji26v_img6.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/vji2jji26v_img7.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>wordcounter.net 域名即关键词 word counter，给谷歌干迷糊了，用户搜索这个词，到底是想找这个网站呢，还是想找其他工具？ 既然不好区分，并且这个站体验还好，那就把这个站放到第一位吧。</div>\n<div>品牌名和关键词相辅相成</div>",
